# Served byte for byte by freshet-state-server (and by any static host an install uses), so
# the bytes in git are the bytes served: text is LF everywhere, and the fonts and
# images are never touched — a line-ending rewrite inside a woff2 corrupts it, and
# the failure looks like a font that silently won't load.
*.html   text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
*.mjs    text eol=lf
*.svg    text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
*.webp   binary
*.woff2  binary
